<title>SPAIN: Spain April currency reserves rose $728.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Spain April currency reserves rose $728.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following provisional figures (millions of dollars)</p>
<p> RESERVES		     APR 97	MAR 97    APR 96</p>
<p> Rise in month		728.3	  368.4    4,384.3</p>
<p> End-month total	 65,903.7     65,175.4   50,006.1</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
